{'symbol': 'ACGL', 'date': '2019-10-07 19:30:00', 'title': 'ARCH CAPITAL GROUP SEES Q3 2019 PRE-TAX CATASTROPHE LOSSES OF ABOUT $65 MLN-$75 MLN', 'text': 'ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. ANNOUNCES CATASTROPHE LOSS ESTIMATES.ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD SEES Q3 2019 PRE-TAX CATASTROPHE LOSSES OF ABOUT $65 MILLION TO $75 MILLION, NET OF REINSURANCE RECOVERIES AND REINSTATEMENT PREMIUMS..ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD - PRE-TAX CATASTROPHE LOSSES ARE PRIMARILY FROM HURRICANE DORIAN AND TYPHOON FAXAI.'}{'symbol': 'ACGL', 'date': '2019-10-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. PROVIDES EARNINGS FORECAST FOR THE THIRD QUARTER 2019', 'text': 'ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. PROVIDED EARNINGS FORECAST FOR THE THIRD QUARTER 2019. FOR THE QUARTER, ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. EXPECTS TO REPORT PRE-TAX CATASTROPHE LOSSES OF APPROXIMATELY $65 MILLION TO $75 MILLION, NET OF REINSURANCE RECOVERIES AND REINSTATEMENT PREMIUMS. THESE LOSSES ARE PRIMARILY FROM HURRICANE DORIAN AND TYPHOON FAXAI. AT THIS TIME, THERE ARE SIGNIFICANT UNCERTAINTIES SURROUNDING THE SCOPE OF DAMAGE FOR THESE EVENTS, AS WELL AS THE OTHER GLOBAL EVENTS. THE COMPANY’S ESTIMATE FOR THESE EVENTS IS BASED ON CURRENTLY AVAILABLE INFORMATION DERIVED FROM MODELING TECHNIQUES, INDUSTRY ASSESSMENT OF EXPOSURE, PRELIMINARY CLAIMS INFORMATION OBTAINED FROM THE COMPANY’S CLIENTS AND BROKERS TO DATE AND A REVIEW OF IN-FORCE CONTRACTS.'}